<section class="section" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
      <span class="badge badge-primary">
        <span class="mono">XAUUSD</span> · Grid strategy automation
      </span>

      <h1 id="hero-heading" class="heading-display mt-6">
        Configure. Connect.<br class="hidden sm:inline">
        Automate your XAUUSD strategy.
      </h1>

      <p class="body-lg mx-auto mt-6 max-w-2xl">
        Set up a gold grid strategy, define the risk limits it must respect, and manage
        it from one place. Execution runs through your own MT5 terminal and your own
        broker — this platform is the control layer.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-9 flex flex-col justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row">
        <%= render "components/button", label: "Get Started", variant: :primary, size: :lg, href: signup_path %>
        <%= render "components/button", label: "How It Works", variant: :outline, size: :lg, href: "#how-it-works" %>
      </div>

      <%#
        No performance figures here by design. The brief forbids profitability
        claims, so the reassurance offered is about control and transparency,
        which are things the product can actually deliver.
      %>
      <p class="caption mt-6">
        You keep your broker relationship. You keep your funds. You set the limits.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
